MINISTRY OF PERSONNEL, PUBLIC GRIEVANCES AND PENSIONS 
(Department of Personnel and Training) 
NOTIFICATION 
New Delhi, the 21st November, 2022 
G.S.R. 830(E).—In exercise of the powers conferred by sub-section (2) of section 14 of the Administrative 
Tribunals Act, 1985 (13 of 1985), the Central Government hereby specifies the 217 November, 2022 as the date on 
and from which the provisions of sub-section (3) of section 14 of the said Act shall apply to the following four 
Regional Boards of Apprenticeship or Practical Training, being autonomous bodies under the Ministry of Education 
and for the said purpose, makes the following further amendment in the notification of the Government of India, in the 
Ministry of Personnel, Public Grievances and Pensions (Department of Personnel and Training) published in the 


Gazette of India, Extraordinary, Part II, Section 3, Sub-section (i) vide number G.S.R.730(E), dated the Qn May, 1986, 
namely:- 


In the Schedule to the said notification, after serial number 215 and the entries relating thereto, the following 
serial numbers and entries shall be inserted, namely:- 


