Mumbai Education 

218. Board of Apprenticeship Training, Northern Region, Autonomous body under the Ministry of 
Kanpur Education 

219. Board of Apprenticeship Training, Southern Region, Autonomous body under the Ministry of 
Chennai Education”. 


